Lower the idle fan speed and keep the iMac Pro under t2fanrd's control.

- min_speed per fan overrides the SMC minimum (fan*_min, 1100 rpm on the iMac
  Pro). The SMC refuses writes to fan*_min but accepts lower speeds in manual
  mode.
- Read /etc/t2fand-quiet.conf, so changes Omarchy makes to /etc/t2fand.conf do
  not reach this build.
- Read the GPU temperature from any DRM card, not only card0. On the iMac Pro the
  Radeon Pro Vega is card1.
- Reassert manual mode with every speed write, and write at least every 30 s. The
  SMC falls back to automatic control after suspend.

Applies to GnomedDev/t2fanrd at 48baf96. GPL-3.0-or-later, like t2fanrd.

